id=axion_spsm
name=Axion Super Power Saving
version=v3.6.2
versionCode=54
author=Axion SPSM
description=v3.6.2 the Recents button fixed at its real cause: this ROM opens recents as a launcher animation, not an activity, so the daemon now watches the animation line and the touchscreen tap on the Recents area, and starts this mode's list, reads the screen back and tries again until it is what is up. Exit times are no longer understated (three stopwatches, not one). New optional 30 fps cap for this 60 Hz panel - 40 cannot be shown, 30 can. RMX3430.
